{
 "about": "Hand-written map from ONSSA index crop names (usage column) to EU product codes (Annex I, Reg. (EC) 396/2005). Written 2026-09-13 by Brice Zemba with Claude; every code is checked against the EU snapshot by tests/test_crop_map.py.",
 "kinds": {
  "exact": "Same crop as the EU code (a tree name maps to its fruit).",
  "group": "ONSSA name covers an EU group; the codes are group codes and cover all their descendants.",
  "narrower": "ONSSA name is a variety or subset of the EU code (e.g. Navel within Oranges). Counts as registered, with a note.",
  "ambiguous": "ONSSA name could mean several EU codes. Never confirms a registration on its own.",
  "nursery": "Nursery use (seedlings). Does not register field use on the harvested crop.",
  "post_harvest": "Treatment of stored or harvested produce. Does not register field use.",
  "non_crop": "Adjuvants, storage premises, ornamentals, lawns, bare soil, feed. No EU food code."
 },
